                    "message": "I am not familiar with this Robot test case, but this looks correct.  OpenBMC user management allows up to 15 IPMI user accounts, and up to 15 non-IPMI users.\nReference for 15 IPMI users: https://github.com/openbmc/docs/blob/master/architecture/user-management.md#recommended-implementation with implementation here: https://github.com/openbmc/phosphor-user-manager/blob/9ca8692dedc633c6d2857f0a8dda8a3437ed50f9/user_mgr.hpp#L44"
